{"type":"message","id":"443da232","parentId":"c7326f65","timestamp":"2026-03-27T01:25:34.717Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about a previous incident where they set up an API2D endpoint but selected the wrong API type (openai-completions instead of anthropic-messages). They want to know how to prevent this issue in the future.\n\nThis seems like a question about OpenClaw configuration. Let me think about this:\n\n1. The user had an API2D server that uses Anthropic's /v1/messages format\n2. They accidentally selected \"openai-completions\" instead of \"anthropic-messages\"\n3. They want to know how to avoid this in the future\n\nThis is likely related to the AI API configuration in OpenClaw. I should check if there's any documentation or configuration files related to this.\n\nActually, I don't have specific memory of setting this up. Let me check if there's a memory file or workspace notes about this. But actually the user is asking a general question - how to avoid selecting the wrong API type in the future. This is more of a guidance question.\n\nLet me think about practical solutions:\n1. API type selection should clearly indicate what format/endpoint it uses\n2. Documentation or labels that show which API type to select for different providers\n3. Auto-detection of the correct API type\n4. Clear naming/description of each API type option\n\nBut I should also check if there's something in the workspace or memory about this specific configuration issue.","thinkingSignature":"5f0a917c80b9ea27d8eef6436acd7c3b37254835dfce82fc1002a83401105ec8"},{"type":"text","text":"这是个配置体验问题，核心是 **API 类型和实际服务器格式不匹配**。\n\n## 根本原因\n\n| 选项 | 实际对应 |\n|------|---------|\n| `openai-completions` | OpenAI `/v1/completions`（GPT-3/Claude 1.x 旧格式） |\n| `anthropic-messages` | Anthropic `/v1/messages`（Claude 3+ / Claude 3.5 新格式） |\n\nAPI2D 这类兼容多个 provider 的转发服务，如果你连的是 **Anthropic 格式的后端**，就必须选 `anthropic-messages`，选 `openai-completions` 会因为路由和 body 格式不同而失效。\n\n## 避免出错的办法\n\n**1. 选之前看 server URL 路径**\n- `/v1/messages` → `anthropic-messages`\n- `/v1/completions` → `openai-completions`\n\n**2. 在 OpenClaw 配置里给这类 provider 加个标注**\n目前配置项只有类型选择，没有来源说明。建议在配置 UI 或文档里加一个 **\"Provider 格式说明\"** 字段——这个可以做为一个 issue 或 PR 提给 OpenClaw。\n\n**3. 我帮你整理一个快速对照表**\n要不要我把这个补充到 workspace 的 `TOOLS.md` 里，以后配置时瞄一眼就行？\n\n---\n\n你当时是配置在哪一步时选错的？我看看能不能针对那个具体场景加个预防提示。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":79,"output":597,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":22587,"totalTokens":23263,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774574714597}}
{"type":"message","id":"15c203fc","parentId":"443da232","timestamp":"2026-03-27T01:27:39.919Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53699e6300a4b49bcefcfcef42c\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-03-27 09:27 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b53699e6300a4b49bcefcfcef42c]\n范: 1 把这个补充到 workspace 的 TOOLS.md 里\n2 在 OpenClaw 配置里给这类 provider 加个标注\n目前配置项只有类型选择，没有来源说明。建议在配置 UI 或文档里加一个 \"Provider 格式说明\" 字段——这个可以做为一个 issue 或 PR 提给 OpenClaw\n把这一项转到项目群里继续"}],"timestamp":1774574859915}}
{"type":"message","id":"0515ef3e","parentId":"15c203fc","timestamp":"2026-03-27T01:27:47.563Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to:\n1. Add the quick reference table to TOOLS.md\n2. Create an issue/PR for OpenClaw about adding format explanation to the provider config\n\nAnd they want me to forward the second item to the project group (the OpenClaw contribution project group). Let me check the AGENTS.md - the project group is `oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3`.\n\nLet me do task 1 first (update TOOLS.md), then send the issue item to the project group.","thinkingSignature":"71dd20b08d3eca49eecdf77ae1efd94c177cb409b177544745db8f76dd4b9c93"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_oy70etmj5k5i_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/TOOLS.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":79,"output":152,"cacheRead":22359,"cacheWrite":810,"totalTokens":23400,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774574859917}}
{"type":"message","id":"61402bcb","parentId":"0515ef3e","timestamp":"2026-03-27T01:27:47.605Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_oy70etmj5k5i_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# TOOLS.md - Local Notes\n\nSkills define _how_ tools work. This file is for _your_ specifics — the stuff that's unique to your setup.\n\n## What Goes Here\n\nThings like:\n\n- Camera names and locations\n- SSH hosts and aliases\n- Preferred voices for TTS\n- Speaker/room names\n- Device nicknames\n- Anything environment-specific\n\n## Examples\n\n```markdown\n### Cameras\n\n- living-room → Main area, 180° wide angle\n- front-door → Entrance, motion-triggered\n\n### SSH\n\n- home-server → 192.168.1.100, user: admin\n\n### TTS\n\n- Preferred voice: \"Nova\" (warm, slightly British)\n- Default speaker: Kitchen HomePod\n```\n\n## Why Separate?\n\nSkills are shared. Your setup is yours. Keeping them apart means you can update skills without losing your notes, and share skills without leaking your infrastructure.\n\n---\n\n## Self-Improvement Skill Notes\n\n- `.learnings/` directory is initialized in this workspace\n- Use it to record **errors, corrections, and missing capabilities**\n- Do not treat `.learnings/` as authoritative memory\n- Before promoting anything from `.learnings/`, verify it is not a one-off or environment-specific issue\n- Never write tokens, passwords, secrets, private code snippets, or user-sensitive data into `.learnings/`\n- Hook mode is currently **not enabled**; keep logging manual unless the user explicitly asks to automate it\n\nAdd whatever helps you do your job. This is your cheat sheet.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774574867587}}
{"type":"message","id":"6146a302","parentId":"61402bcb","timestamp":"2026-03-27T01:27:58.166Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me add the API provider format reference table to TOOLS.md and then send the issue item to the project group.","thinkingSignature":"4e1272e0471777c4eb20cb383afc2d3c9e33b2e8d847d297ed7389a652a86d4e"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_frv75rlsnird_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/TOOLS.md","old_string":"Add whatever helps you do your job. This is your cheat sheet.","new_string":"Add whatever helps you do your job. This is your cheat sheet.\n\n---\n\n## API Provider 类型对照表（配置防错）\n\n配置自定义 provider 时，**API 类型**需与服务器的 **实际 endpoint 路径** 对应：\n\n| API 类型 | 对应 endpoint 路径 | 适用场景 |\n|----------|-------------------|---------|\n| `openai-completions` | `/v1/completions` | GPT-3 / Claude 1.x 旧格式（极少用） |\n| `anthropic-messages` | `/v1/messages` | Claude 3 / Claude 3.5 / Claude 4 新格式 |\n\n**配置前先看 server URL：**\n- 看到 `/v1/messages` → 选 `anthropic-messages`\n- 看到 `/v1/completions` → 选 `openai-completions`\n\n**常见兼容层 provider 示例：**\n- **API2D**：同时支持多种格式，确认你的 endpoint 对应哪个格式\n- **OneAPI**：注意渠道配置里的 `model` 映射到哪个后端格式\n\n**教训记录（2026-03-27）：**\nAPI2D 服务器用 Anthropic 格式（`/v1/messages`），但误选了 `openai-completions`，导致路由和 body 格式不匹配。修改为 `anthropic-messages` 后解决。"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1596,"output":379,"cacheRead":22134,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24109,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774574867605}}
{"type":"message","id":"88971f41","parentId":"6146a302","timestamp":"2026-03-27T01:27:58.208Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_frv75rlsnird_1","toolName":"edit","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully replaced text in /root/.openclaw/workspace/TOOLS.md."}],"details":{"diff":"    ...\n 46 - Never write tokens, passwords, secrets, private code snippets, or user-sensitive data into `.learnings/`\n 47 - Hook mode is currently **not enabled**; keep logging manual unless the user explicitly asks to automate it\n 48 \n 49 Add whatever helps you do your job. This is your cheat sheet.\n+50 \n+51 ---\n+52 \n+53 ## API Provider 类型对照表（配置防错）\n+54 \n+55 配置自定义 provider 时，**API 类型**需与服务器的 **实际 endpoint 路径** 对应：\n+56 \n+57 | API 类型 | 对应 endpoint 路径 | 适用场景 |\n+58 |----------|-------------------|---------|\n+59 | `openai-completions` | `/v1/completions` | GPT-3 / Claude 1.x 旧格式（极少用） |\n+60 | `anthropic-messages` | `/v1/messages` | Claude 3 / Claude 3.5 / Claude 4 新格式 |\n+61 \n+62 **配置前先看 server URL：**\n+63 - 看到 `/v1/messages` → 选 `anthropic-messages`\n+64 - 看到 `/v1/completions` → 选 `openai-completions`\n+65 \n+66 **常见兼容层 provider 示例：**\n+67 - **API2D**：同时支持多种格式，确认你的 endpoint 对应哪个格式\n+68 - **OneAPI**：注意渠道配置里的 `model` 映射到哪个后端格式\n+69 \n+70 **教训记录（2026-03-27）：**\n+71 API2D 服务器用 Anthropic 格式（`/v1/messages`），但误选了 `openai-completions`，导致路由和 body 格式不匹配。修改为 `anthropic-messages` 后解决。","firstChangedLine":50},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774574878191}}
{"type":"message","id":"99270830","parentId":"88971f41","timestamp":"2026-03-27T01:28:08.461Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me send the issue item to the OpenClaw project group. The group chat ID is `oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3`.","thinkingSignature":"7ee01daa2d028e34ceb672ad5e90652eaa4123bd7460c408c5db876a24da7e88"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_o7elslifepcm_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"feishu","target":"chat:oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3","message":"📋 新 Issue 提案：OpenClaw 配置页缺少 Provider 格式说明字段\n\n**问题描述：**\n目前自定义 provider 配置界面只有 API 类型下拉选项（如 `openai-completions`、`anthropic-messages`），但没有说明每个选项对应的 endpoint 格式。用户在配置 API2D 等兼容层时，容易选错类型（例如把 Anthropic 格式的服务器误配为 `openai-completions`），导致请求失败。\n\n**建议方案（二选一或同时做）：**\n1. **配置页加提示文字**：在 API 类型下拉框旁边加一个 info icon 或 tooltip，写明各选项对应的 endpoint 路径（如 `anthropic-messages → /v1/messages`）\n2. **文档补充**：在 \"Custom Provider\" 相关文档里加一张格式对照表\n\n**优先级：** P3（体验优化，非阻塞）\n\n**涉及文件（待确认）：**\n- 可能需要找 frontend 配置组件\n- 文档页面位置待调研\n\n是否要 xixi 调研确定具体改哪个文件？"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":2006,"output":337,"cacheRead":22134,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24477,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774574878207}}
