{"type":"message","id":"76ce6845","parentId":"d85cec9c","timestamp":"2026-03-27T12:59:11.155Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5353bf13b0bcc3967c94d24be6b\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-03-27 20:59 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b5353bf13b0bcc3967c94d24be6b]\n范: 我想增加这个模型配置 SSOT 规则，你看看这个规则有没有问题，没问题就写进 [agents.md](agents.md)里\n\n唯一真源：\n\\- models.providers.<provider\\>.models\n这里负责：\n\\- 模型是否存在\n\\- 模型真实 id\n\\- name\n\\- input\n\\- provider 归属\n\\- API 类型 / baseUrl / key 所属上下文\n\n\nagents.defaults.models 的定位\n它不再手工维护。\n改成：\n\\- 展示层 / 暴露层\n\\- 由 models.providers.\\*.models 派生\n\\- 必须和真源同步\n\\- 不允许单独手改新增真实模型\n\n\n以后操作规则\n新增模型\n只改：\n\\- models.providers.<provider\\>.models\n删除模型\n只改：\n\\- models.providers.<provider\\>.models\n改模型 id / name / input\n只改：\n\\- models.providers.<provider\\>.models\n改 provider\n只改：\n\\- 原 provider 和目标 provider 的 models\n\n\n同步规则\n改完真源后，再执行一次同步，把结果写入：\n\\- agents.defaults.models\n也就是说：\n\\- providers = source of truth\n\\- agents.defaults.models = generated view\n\n\n禁止事项\n以后避免这两种操作：\n1. 只改 agents.defaults.models 不改 provider\n2. 两边手动各改一遍\n这就是过去几天反复出问题的根源。\n\n最佳实践\n我建议补一条工程规则：\n\\- 凡是模型配置改动，必须先改 SSOT\n\\- 凡是提交前，必须做一次同步校验"}],"timestamp":1774616351151}}
{"type":"message","id":"a215d0e5","parentId":"76ce6845","timestamp":"2026-03-27T12:59:36.742Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to review this SSOT (Single Source of Truth) rule for model configuration and if it looks good, write it into AGENTS.md. Let me read the current AGENTS.md first to understand the structure, then evaluate the rules.\n\nThe rules are about:\n1. `models.providers.<provider>.models` is the single source of truth for model configs\n2. `agents.defaults.models` becomes a derived/view layer, not manually maintained\n3. Operations rules: only modify the SSOT for add/delete/update\n4. Sync rule: after changing SSOT, sync to `agents.defaults.models`\n5. Forbidden: don't modify `agents.defaults.models` alone, don't modify both manually\n\n\n6. The core principle is that any model config change must update the SSOT first and verify sync before committing.\n\nNow I'm reviewing the actual structure in openclaw.json to validate whether the proposed separation between providers and agent defaults aligns with how the config actually works. The `arkcode` provider uses `openai-completions` while `doubao-2` uses `anthropic-messages`, which suggests the API type is indeed per-provider rather than per-model. The real issue from the API2D mistake was confusing API type with API format—selecting `openai-completions` when the server actually expects `anthropic-messages`. This SSOT rule looks solid overall, though I should flag that it needs to account for provider-level settings like API type and baseUrl, not just model-level ones. I need to verify the SSOT rule is actually consistent with what I implemented. Looking at the config, `arkcode/glm-4.7` and `doubao-2/doubao-seed-2.0-code` are listed as fallbacks in `agents.defaults.models`, but I should check if those exact model IDs actually exist under their provider's models list in `models.providers`. If they don't, that would be a problem—this rule assumes the fallbacks are already properly defined in the providers section first. I need to verify whether `glm-4.7` actually exists under the `arkcode` provider in the config, since I'm not certain of the exact model ID. The user's rule is fundamentally sound—`models.providers` should be the source of truth—but I should flag this uncertainty before writing it to AGENTS.md, and also note that the current fallback configuration might not align with what's actually defined in the providers section.","thinkingSignature":"d8c785bac15c7a8a4920023132812095f4d6508a229808dc873079d89f2ee0c4"},{"type":"text","text":"规则逻辑很清晰，整体没问题，但有 2 个点需要确认后再写进去：\n\n**1. 要不要把 API type / baseUrl / key 加进 SSOT 范围**\n\n目前规则写的是：\n```\n- API 类型 / baseUrl / key 所属上下文\n```\n\n但 SSOT 文件（`models.providers.<provider>.models`）只覆盖了模型这个层级，API type、baseUrl、key 是 provider 级别，不是模型级别。如果你也想把 provider 级别的配置一起纳入 SSOT 概念，应该写成：\n\n> models.providers.<provider> 整体（含 api、baseUrl、apiKey、models）是真源  \n> agents.defaults.models 由其派生\n\n**2. 当前的 fallback 配置和真源是否对齐**\n\n刚才设置的 fallback：\n- `arkcode/glm-4.7`\n- `doubao-2/doubao-seed-2.0-code`\n\n我需要确认一下这两个模型 ID 是否在 provider 配置里真实存在：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_a7otajnu6zav_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json | python3 -c \"\nimport json,sys\nc = json.load(sys.stdin)\nproviders = c.get('models', {}).get('providers', {})\nfor p, v in providers.items():\n    models = v.get('models', [])\n    print(f'\\n[{p}] api={v.get(\\\"api\\\")}')\n    for m in models:\n        print(f'  - {m.get(\\\"id\\\")} ({m.get(\\\"name\\\",\\\"\\\")})')\n\"","timeout":8}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":79,"output":848,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":29522,"totalTokens":30449,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774616351153}}
{"type":"message","id":"f2de733b","parentId":"a215d0e5","timestamp":"2026-03-27T12:59:36.802Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_a7otajnu6zav_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[doubao] api=openai-completions\n  - doubao-seedream-5-0-260128 (Doubao Seedream 5.0)\n\n[arkcode] api=anthropic-messages\n  - doubao-seed-2.0-code (Doubao Seed 2.0 Code)\n  - doubao-seed-2.0-pro (Doubao Seed 2.0 Pro)\n  - ark-code-latest (ARK Code Latest)\n  - doubao-seed-code (Doubao Seed Code)\n  - glm-4.7 (GLM-4.7)\n  - deepseek-v3.2 (DeepSeek V3.2)\n  - kimi-k2-thinking (Kimi K2 Thinking)\n  - kimi-k2.5 (Kimi K2.5)\n\n[minimax] api=anthropic-messages\n  - MiniMax-M2.7 (MiniMax M2.7)\n  - MiniMax-M2.5 (MiniMax M2.5)\n  - MiniMax-M2.5-highspeed (MiniMax M2.5 Highspeed)\n  - MiniMax-M2.5-Lightning (MiniMax M2.5 Lightning)\n  - MiniMax-M2.1 (MiniMax M2.1)\n  - MiniMax-M2.1-lightning (MiniMax M2.1 Lightning)\n  - MiniMax-M2 (MiniMax M2)\n\n[bujing] api=anthropic-messages\n  - claude-opus-4-6 (Claude Opus 4.6)\n  - claude-sonnet-4-6 (Claude Sonnet 4.6)\n  - claude-haiku-4-5-20251001 (Claude Haiku 4.5)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":41,"aggregated":"[doubao] api=openai-completions\n  - doubao-seedream-5-0-260128 (Doubao Seedream 5.0)\n\n[arkcode] api=anthropic-messages\n  - doubao-seed-2.0-code (Doubao Seed 2.0 Code)\n  - doubao-seed-2.0-pro (Doubao Seed 2.0 Pro)\n  - ark-code-latest (ARK Code Latest)\n  - doubao-seed-code (Doubao Seed Code)\n  - glm-4.7 (GLM-4.7)\n  - deepseek-v3.2 (DeepSeek V3.2)\n  - kimi-k2-thinking (Kimi K2 Thinking)\n  - kimi-k2.5 (Kimi K2.5)\n\n[minimax] api=anthropic-messages\n  - MiniMax-M2.7 (MiniMax M2.7)\n  - MiniMax-M2.5 (MiniMax M2.5)\n  - MiniMax-M2.5-highspeed (MiniMax M2.5 Highspeed)\n  - MiniMax-M2.5-Lightning (MiniMax M2.5 Lightning)\n  - MiniMax-M2.1 (MiniMax M2.1)\n  - MiniMax-M2.1-lightning (MiniMax M2.1 Lightning)\n  - MiniMax-M2 (MiniMax M2)\n\n[bujing] api=anthropic-messages\n  -