{"type":"message","id":"dcfd6736","parentId":"f2de733b","timestamp":"2026-03-27T12:59:44.595Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK, so looking at the actual config:\n\n- `arkcode` provider has `glm-4.7` ✅\n- `arkcode` provider has `doubao-seed-2.0-code` ✅ (note: this is under `arkcode`, not `doubao-2`!)\n\nWait - there's no `doubao-2` provider! The `doubao-seed-2.0-code` is under `arkcode` provider, not `doubao-2`. But in the fallback I set `doubao-2/doubao-seed-2.0-code`. That's wrong!\n\nLet me check - where did `doubao-2` come from? Let me look at the full providers section again.","thinkingSignature":"9ade6dbd68d001fd040bdabd65390149e70746f596ce20b6de272124dc78d639"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_qumvt808g9go_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json | python3 -c \"\nimport json,sys\nc = json.load(sys.stdin)\nproviders = c.get('models', {}).get('providers', {})\nprint('All providers:', list(providers.keys()))\n\"","timeout":8}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":8700,"output":234,"cacheRead":22134,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":31068,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774616376802}}
