{"type":"message","id":"db564c97","parentId":"82d655f8","timestamp":"2026-03-27T12:59:55.402Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"There's no `doubao-2` provider! The current fallbacks I set are:\n- `arkcode/glm-4.7` ✅ exists\n- `doubao-2/doubao-seed-2.0-code` ❌ `doubao-2` doesn't exist! The model `doubao-seed-2.0-code` is under `arkcode` provider.\n\nSo the fallback is wrong. I need to correct it to `arkcode/doubao-seed-2.0-code`.\n\nAlso, I should note this in the SSOT rules - this is exactly the kind of error the SSOT rule is designed to prevent!","thinkingSignature":"3864814d3a796f4ff068cd4c6fb4a56331edc63f711f15bb7f21cf03c6755864"},{"type":"text","text":"发现问题：当前 fallback 配置有错误。\n\n**排查结果：**\n\n| 设置的 fallback | 实际情况 | 状态 |\n|----------------|---------|------|\n| `arkcode/glm-4.7` | ✅ 存在于 `arkcode` | 正确 |\n| `doubao-2/doubao-seed-2.0-code` | ❌ 没有 `doubao-2` 这个 provider | 错误 |\n\n`doubao-seed-2.0-code` 实际在 `arkcode` provider 下。所以刚才那个 fallback 写错了，现在同步规则检查正好能 catch 这个问题——**这正是 SSOT 规则的价值**。\n\n先修正这个问题：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_xeiuzkme016s_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport json\n\nwith open('/root/.openclaw/openclaw.json', 'r') as f:\n    config = json.load(f)\n\nconfig['agents']['defaults']['model']['fallbacks'] = [\n    'arkcode/glm-4.7',\n    'arkcode/doubao-seed-2.0-code'\n]\n\nwith open('/root/.openclaw/openclaw.json', 'w') as f:\n    json.dump(config, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n\nprint('Fixed')\n\"","timeout":8}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":8969,"output":410,"cacheRead":22134,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":31513,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774616384655}}
