{"type":"message","id":"36b1f8c2","parentId":"25c93f3f","timestamp":"2026-03-27T13:03:09.892Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to do a full SSOT rule compliance check on the current config. Let me check:\n\n1. Are all models in agents.defaults.models present in providers?\n2. Are there any models in agents.defaults that don't exist in providers?\n3. Are agents.defaults.models entries properly formed as `<provider>/<model-id>`?\n\nCurrent state:\n- providers: doubao, arkcode, minimax, bujing\n- agents.defaults.model.primary: minimax/MiniMax-M2.7\n- agents.defaults.model.fallbacks: ['arkcode/glm-4.7', 'arkcode/doubao-seed-2.0-code']\n\n\n- All referenced models exist in their respective providers, and the format is correct. Since agents.defaults only contains primary and fallbacks rather than a complete list of all models, I can't verify whether there are additional models in providers that aren't exposed in agents.defaults. I should clarify what's actually being validated here.\n\nAccording to SSOT rules, agents.defaults.models should function as a generated view derived from providers, so it would ideally include all models from all providers. The current setup shows a gap: agents.defaults only exposes what's currently configured (primary + fallbacks), missing other available models like doubao-seedream-5-0-260128 or deepseek-v3.2 from arkcode. Additionally, the models configuration appears to be missing from agents.defaults entirely.","thinkingSignature":"2191dfe517b16f8fceba72513deef7fd44de343d4c22d2f48f74797dd8399599"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_dhzaivpzg574_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport json\nc = json.load(open('/root/.openclaw/openclaw.json'))\n\nproviders = c.get('models',{}).get('providers',{})\ndefaults = c.get('agents',{}).get('defaults',{})\n\n# 1. Build all model references in defaults (primary + fallbacks + models entries)\nprimary = defaults.get('model',{}).get('primary')\nfallbacks = defaults.get('model',{}).get('fallbacks',[])\nmodels_entries = defaults.get('models',{})\n\nprint('=== SSOT 检查 ===\\n')\n\n# 2. Check each default model reference exists in provider\nissues = []\n\nall_refs = [primary] + fallbacks + list(models_entries.keys())\nprint('所有引用的模型:')\nfor r in all_refs:\n    print(f'  {r}')\n\nprint()\nfor ref in all_refs:\n    if ref.startswith('^'):\n        continue\n    if '/' not in str(ref):\n        issues.append(f'格式错误: {ref} 缺少 provider 前缀')\n        continue\n    prov, model_id = ref.split('/', 1)\n    prov_data = providers.get(prov, {})\n    prov_models = [m['id'] for m in prov_data.get('models',[])]\n    if model_id not in prov_models:\n        issues.append(f'不存在: {ref} (provider {prov} 下没有 {model_id})')\n    else:\n        print(f'✅ {ref}')\n\nprint()\nif issues:\n    print('问题:')\n    for i in issues:\n        print(f'  ❌ {i}')\nelse:\n    print('✅ 所有引用都同步')\n\nprint()\nprint('=== agents.defaults.models 当前内容 ===')\nprint(json.dumps(models_entries, indent=2))\n\nprint()\nprint('=== provider 完整模型列表 ===')\nfor p, v in providers.items():\n    print(f'{p}: {[m[\\\"id\\\"] for m in v.get(\\\"models\\\",[])]}')\n\"\n","timeout":8}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":79,"output":744,"cacheRead":33075,"cacheWrite":158,"totalTokens":34056,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774616567129}}
